Six-character edition modifications (2026): automatic bounded runtime GLB
loading, six selectable rigged actors, local replacement validation, memory-only
import lifecycle and independent animation controllers. Corresponding code and
original-asset source are provided in source.zip and at
https://github.com/JerryZRic/ai-friends-kart-web

The included kart-r12-chassis.glb derives only from the original kart, without
its baked driver, plus a steering pivot. The six character GLBs under
assets/drivers/ are third-party models expressly excluded from the AGPL grant.
